     6	| Stack | Monorepo uses pnpm 9 and Turbo; web app is Next.js 16 / React 19 / TypeScript with app router; DB package uses Drizzle and node-postgres; state is primarily Zustand persisted stores; styling is Tailwind/DaisyUI. Sources: package.json, apps/web/package.json, packages/db/src/index.ts. |
     7	| Feature surface | Discovered platform pages /, /login, /signup, /profile, /leaderboards; 25 game page routes including hill-climb-poc; 7 standalone app page routes; API routes for NextAuth, signup, progress, profile, gaming-profile, leaderboards, admin backfill, and ROM proxy. Sources: apps/web/src/app/**/page.tsx and route.ts discovery. |
     8	| Inventory method | Catalog routes and registry metadata first, then read stores/components/API handlers for behavior. Use progress schemas and leaderboard extractors as backstops for valid app IDs, persisted state, and leaderboard-enabled experiences. Delegate broad code discovery to read-only subagents by platform/apps/game slices; main thread remains single writer of this workbook. |
     9	| Spreadsheet schema | Canonical artifact is this single workbook at quality/behavior-spec.xlsx. Feature Spec columns are Area, Feature ID, User story, Expected behavior (from code), Status, Defects, Type, Notes / source, Test approach, Open questions, Loop iteration, Last test evidence, Last updated. Status values will flow Spec'd -> Tested-Pass / Tested-Fail -> Fixed -> Verified. |
    10	| Existing tests | Vitest jsdom is configured with setup mocks for localStorage/sessionStorage, matchMedia, ResizeObserver, and WebGL. Existing tests cover home branding/discovery plus Arkanoid and Monster Truck focused tests. Sources: apps/web/vitest.config.ts, apps/web/src/__tests__, apps/web/src/games/*/__tests__. |
    11	| Loop test approach | Use strongest practical method per story: Playwright/browser automation for page and game flows, existing Vitest suites for stores/components, route/schema unit tests for APIs, and documented static checks only where runtime execution is genuinely unavailable. Record actual evidence back into Feature Spec and Loop Log before fixes. |
